  "details": "- Issue\n\nThe avatar overlay can, and is, used by players as an in-built ESP, allowing them to see others through walls in game worlds. Primarily in worlds focused around PvP, like Prison Escape, players can cheat by seeing other people through walls when they shouldn’t be able to, making game worlds worse and even unplayable at times.\n\n- Fix\n\nThe avatar overlay should be a world setting and NOT a per-instance setting. It’s useful in an Avatar Testing world, but in any other world such as Prison Escape, Blackout!, Ghost, Infected: Reborn, Murder 4 and more it should not be enabled. The personal mirror is equally problematic, but at least with that a world creator can make a shader to prevent abuse of the mirror easily.",
